    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Gumpy Brawl, the competitive multiplayer platformer where vintage cartoons meet chaotic action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a universe inspired by old-school cartoons, where up to 16 players face off in hilarious, intense, and unforgiving challenges. From frantic races to absurd traps and slapstick eliminations, every match is a mix of laughs and high-stakes tension. In Gumpy Brawl, expect the unexpected\u2014and maybe an anvil or two! Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Unique Visual Style:</strong> Step into a hand-drawn cartoon world filled with expressive characters and richly detailed, retro-inspired environments. The charm of old-school animation meets a modern twist of dark humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16-Player Competitive Multiplayer:</strong> Join chaotic matches where every player fights to be the last one standing. Team up, betray, or outsmart your opponents in fast-paced action-packed rounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible Yet Strategic Gameplay:</strong> Run, jump, dive, and use clever traps to hinder your rivals. Each level is packed with inventive obstacles and hilarious interactions that test your skills and wits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse and Dynamic Arenas:</strong> Travel through animated worlds where anything can happen: quirky factories, monochrome jungles teeming with hazards, and wacky cityscapes. Every map offers its own unique challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Soundtrack &amp; Slapstick Effects:</strong> Groove to jazz and ragtime tunes while enjoying exaggerated sound effects that add an extra layer of comedy to every encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hilarious Cartoon Eliminations:</strong> Drown in lava, get crushed by tentacles or living trees, or watch your opponents get flung into oblivion. Every elimination is a spectacle of exaggerated animations and confetti explosions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Universe Full of Madness:</strong> You're a gladiator trapped in an interdimensional arena controlled by aliens who crave chaos and entertainment. Stay alive to earn your freedom or go out in slapstick glory!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Gumpy Brawl, the competitive multiplayer platformer where vintage cartoons meet chaotic action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a universe inspired by old-school cartoons, where up to 16 players face off in hilarious, intense, and unforgiving challenges. From frantic races to absurd traps and slapstick eliminations, every match is a mix of laughs and high-stakes tension. In Gumpy Brawl, expect the unexpected\u2014and maybe an anvil or two! Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Unique Visual Style:</strong> Step into a hand-drawn cartoon world filled with expressive characters and richly detailed, retro-inspired environments. The charm of old-school animation meets a modern twist of dark humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16-Player Competitive Multiplayer:</strong> Join chaotic matches where every player fights to be the last one standing. Team up, betray, or outsmart your opponents in fast-paced action-packed rounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible Yet Strategic Gameplay:</strong> Run, jump, dive, and use clever traps to hinder your rivals. Each level is packed with inventive obstacles and hilarious interactions that test your skills and wits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse and Dynamic Arenas:</strong> Travel through animated worlds where anything can happen: quirky factories, monochrome jungles teeming with hazards, and wacky cityscapes. Every map offers its own unique challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Soundtrack &amp; Slapstick Effects:</strong> Groove to jazz and ragtime tunes while enjoying exaggerated sound effects that add an extra layer of comedy to every encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hilarious Cartoon Eliminations:</strong> Drown in lava, get crushed by tentacles or living trees, or watch your opponents get flung into oblivion. Every elimination is a spectacle of exaggerated animations and confetti explosions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Universe Full of Madness:</strong> You're a gladiator trapped in an interdimensional arena controlled by aliens who crave chaos and entertainment. Stay alive to earn your freedom or go out in slapstick glory!</p></li></ul>",
